{
  "id": "RAW_fa65cf56f3",
  "title": "OpenAI 发布 GPT-Live-1.1 语音智能体模型，将待机成本降至 $0.02/分钟",
  "url": "https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/21/openai-gpt-live-1-1-api-standby-mode/",
  "date": "2026-11-21 19:46:19",
  "author": "Michal Sutter",
  "siteName": "MarkTechPost",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_top  tdi_77 td_block_template_1\">\n   <!-- MTP Preferred Source badge : DESKTOP (plain link, no script; hidden below 640px) -->\n   <div id=\"mtp-pref-desk\">\n    <a class=\"mtp-pref-btn\" href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=marktechpost.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Add Marktechpost as a preferred source on Google\"><img src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/googleg/1x/googleg_standard_color_128dp.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"mtp-pref-txt\"><span style=\"display:block!important\">Add as a preferred</span><span style=\"display:block!important\">source on Google</span></span></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">OpenAI has made <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-live-1.1\">GPT-Live-1.1</a> available in its API under the model ID <code>gpt-live-1.1</code>. The <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-live-1.1\">GPT-Live-1.1 voice model</a> is a full-duplex model for multilingual conversations. It can listen while it speaks. OpenAI team states that it <a href=\"https://x.com/OpenAIDevs/status/2123506733524136446\">speaks with more natural and consistent accents across languages</a> and completes tasks more reliably. The release also adds standby, a cheaper billing state for idle sessions. For teams running voice agents, idle time on a call now costs less. You can check the deployment options and specs here through our <strong><a href=\"https://aicampaign.live/gpu-1\">GPULeaderboard.com chrome extension</a></strong>.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-tl-dr\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li><strong>Size:</strong> Live sessions hold a <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/live-conversations\">128,000-token default context window</a>.</li>\n   <li><strong>Runs on:</strong> OpenAI’s cloud only, via <code>v1/live/sessions</code>. Clients connect over WebRTC or WebSocket. No open weights, no quantized variants.</li>\n   <li><strong>Performance:</strong> OpenAI claims better accents, transcription, letter and number handling, and task completion than GPT-Live-1. No scores published.</li>\n   <li><strong>Best:</strong> Standby bills idle WebRTC time at <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-live-1.1\">$0.02 per minute versus $0.05 active</a>, a 60% lower rate.</li>\n   <li><strong>Worst:</strong> OpenAI published 0 benchmark scores for 1.1. Image, video and structured outputs are not supported.</li>\n   <li><strong>Bottom line:</strong> Best: cheaper always-on voice sessions. Worst: quality gains are self-reported with no numbers.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <h2 id=\"h-what-is-gpt-live-1-1\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is GPT-Live-1.1?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">GPT-Live-1.1 is a full-duplex speech model from OpenAI that hears and speaks in 1 stream. It follows <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-live-1-in-the-api/\">GPT-Live-1, which reached the API on September 10, 2026</a>. As per the <a href=\"https://community.openai.com/t/gpt-live-1-1-has-arrived-in-the-api/1418537\">OpenAI forum announcement</a>, it has powered ChatGPT Plus and Pro voice since October 15.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Inputs and outputs are audio and text. Image and video are not supported. Streaming and function calling work. Structured outputs, fine-tuning and predicted outputs do not.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-gpt-live-1-1-work\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does GPT-Live-1.1 work?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The GPT-Live family replaces the usual cascade of speech-to-text, an LLM and text-to-speech. OpenAI says the model <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-live-1-in-the-api/\">reasons over incoming and outgoing audio together in a single model</a>. It also handles turn detection and returns ASR transcripts natively.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Deeper work is delegated. The voice model can hand reasoning and tool calls to a backend text model. OpenAI names GPT-6 Astra for complex issues and Luna for high-volume tasks. Third-party backends also work.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/live-conversations\">Live conversations guide</a> sets <code>delegation.type</code> to <code>client</code> or <code>responses</code>. Responses mode uses OpenAI models. Client mode connects your own backend. Instructions can run up to 16,384 tokens.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-what-changed-from-gpt-live-1\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What changed from GPT-Live-1?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>OpenAI lists 4 improvement areas for 1.1:</strong></p>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>More natural and consistent accents across languages</li>\n   <li>More accurate speech transcription</li>\n   <li>Better handling of precise details like letters and numbers</li>\n   <li>More reliable instruction following and task completion</li>\n  </ul>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-standby-mode-work\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does standby mode work?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Standby pauses inference during silence while the WebRTC connection stays open. <strong>The <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/live-conversations\">guide</a> documents 3 settings:</strong></p>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li><code>session.wake_policy.type</code>: set to <code>speech</code>, so inference waits for speech</li>\n   <li><code>session.idle_timeout_s</code>: a whole number from 5 to 60 seconds</li>\n   <li><code>session.wake_policy.vad_threshold</code>: optional, 0 to 1, default 0.5</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After the timeout, the server emits <code>session.paused</code>. When the user speaks, <code>session.resumed</code> fires. The session ID and history are kept. OpenAI warns the first reply after a short utterance may be slower. Keep the microphone track active during standby.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Standby works for both GPT-Live-1 and GPT-Live-1.1.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-much-does-gpt-live-1-1-cost\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How much does GPT-Live-1.1 cost?</strong></h2>\n  <figure class=\"wp-block-table\">\n   <table class=\"has-fixed-layout\">\n    <thead>\n     <tr>\n      <th>Session state</th>\n      <th>Price per minute</th>\n      <th>Price per hour</th>\n     </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Active</td>\n      <td>$0.05</td>\n      <td>$3.00</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Standby (WebRTC, inference paused)</td>\n      <td>$0.02</td>\n      <td>$1.20</td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </figure>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Voice sessions are billed by duration. The <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-live-1\">GPT-Live-1 model page</a> says billing is per second. Backend model and tool usage are billed separately. That matters: a heavy backend can cost more than the voice layer.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-deployment-and-availability\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Deployment and availability</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The model is API-only. You switch an existing Live session by setting <code>model</code> to <code>gpt-live-1.1</code>. Changing the model requires a new session.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://openai.com/products/release-notes/\">Outbound SIP calling</a> reached all organizations on November 2, so phone agents are supported. GPT-Live-1 and GPT-Live-1.1 have separate concurrent-session limits. Each limit applies across inference regions. The 1.1 page does not publish tier numbers.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-gpt-live-1-1-compare\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does GPT-Live-1.1 compare?</strong></h2>\n  <figure class=\"wp-block-table\">\n   <table class=\"has-fixed-layout\">\n    <thead>\n     <tr>\n      <th>Feature</th>\n      <th>GPT-Live-1.1</th>\n      <th><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-live-1\">GPT-Live-1</a></th>\n      <th><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-realtime-2.1\">GPT-Realtime-2.1</a></th>\n      <th><a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models/gemini-3.8-live\">Gemini 3.8 Live</a></th>\n     </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Developer</td>\n      <td>OpenAI</td>\n      <td>OpenAI</td>\n      <td>OpenAI</td>\n      <td>Google</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Parameters</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Input</td>\n      <td>Audio, text</td>\n      <td>Audio, text</td>\n      <td>Text, audio, image</td>\n      <td>Text, image, audio</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Output</td>\n      <td>Audio, text</td>\n      <td>Audio, text</td>\n      <td>Text, audio</td>\n      <td>Text, audio</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Context</td>\n      <td>128K default (<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/live-conversations\">guide</a>)</td>\n      <td>128K default (<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/live-conversations\">guide</a>)</td>\n      <td>128K, 32K max output</td>\n      <td>131,072 in, 65,536 out</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Pricing</td>\n      <td>$0.05/min active, $0.02/min standby</td>\n      <td>$0.05/min active, $0.02/min standby</td>\n      <td>$32 / $64 per 1M audio tokens (in/out)</td>\n      <td>Token-based (<a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing\">pricing</a>)</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Idle standby billing</td>\n      <td>Yes (WebRTC)</td>\n      <td>Yes (WebRTC)</td>\n      <td>Not documented</td>\n      <td>Not documented</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Reasoning</td>\n      <td>Delegated to backend model</td>\n      <td>Delegated to backend model</td>\n      <td>Built in, configurable effort</td>\n      <td>Interleaved reasoning</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Function calling</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n      <td>Yes</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Structured outputs</td>\n      <td>No</td>\n      <td>No</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n      <td>No</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Published benchmarks</td>\n      <td>None for 1.1</td>\n      <td>Full Duplex Bench +30 pts vs GPT-Realtime-2.1</td>\n      <td>Baseline in that eval</td>\n      <td>Not compared</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>License / weights</td>\n      <td>Closed, API only</td>\n      <td>Closed, API only</td>\n      <td>Closed, API only</td>\n      <td>Closed, API only</td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </figure>\n  <div id=\"mtp-gl11-wrap\" style=\"margin:24px auto;\">\n   <iframe class=\"lazyload\" id=\"mtp-gl11-frame\" title=\"GPT-Live-1.1 interactive explainer\" loading=\"lazy\" srcdoc=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width,initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;GPT-Live-1.1 explained | Marktechpost&lt;/title&gt;&lt;style&gt;html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:transparent}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;style&gt;\n#mtp-gl11{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;background:#0d0d0d!important;color:#f2f2f2!important;border:1px solid #2a2a2a!important;border-radius:16px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box}\n#mtp-gl11 *{box-sizing:border-box}\n#mtp-gl11 hr,#mtp-gl11 p:empty,#mtp-gl11 del,#mtp-gl11 s{display:none!important}\n#mtp-gl11 .hd{padding:22px 24px 14px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 92% 0%,rgba(240,160,106,.25),transparent 45%),radial-gradient(circle at 70% 120%,rgba(91,140,247,.22),transparent 50%)!important}\n#mtp-gl11 .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0d0d0d!important;background:#f2f2f2!important;border-radius:99px;padding:3px 10px;font-weight:700}\n#mtp-gl11 h3{margin:10px 0 4px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;color:#fff!important}\n#mtp-gl11 .sub{margin:0;color:#a9a9a9!important;font-size:14px}\n#mtp-gl11 .tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:0 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #262626!important;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#mtp-gl11 .tab{background:transparent!important;color:#9a9a9a!important;border:0!important;border-bottom:2px solid transparent!important;padding:12px 10px;font:600 14px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}\n#mtp-gl11 .tab.on{color:#fff!important;border-bottom-color:#F0A06A!important}\n#mtp-gl11 .pn{display:none;padding:20px 24px 8px;animation:gl11fade .35s ease}\n#mtp-gl11 .pn.on{display:block}\n@keyframes gl11fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n#mtp-gl11 .row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#mtp-gl11 .btn{background:#f2f2f2!important;color:#0d0d0d!important;border:0!important;border-radius:99px;padding:8px 16px;font:700 13px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}\n#mtp-gl11 .btn.gh{background:transparent!important;color:#f2f2f2!important;border:1px solid #3a3a3a!important}\n#mtp-gl11 .note{font-size:12px;color:#8a8a8a!important;margin:10px 0}\n#mtp-gl11 .box{background:#151515!important;border:1px solid #2a2a2a!important;border-radius:12px;padding:14px}\n#mtp-gl11 svg text{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}\n#mtp-gl11 .node{transition:all .4s}\n#mtp-gl11 .flow{stroke-dasharray:6 6;animation:gl11dash 1s linear infinite}\n@keyframes gl11dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:-12}}\n#mtp-gl11 .pulse{animation:gl11pulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;transform-origin:center;transform-box:fill-box}\n@keyframes gl11pulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}50%{transform:scale(1.08);opacity:.85}}\n#mtp-gl11 .dim{opacity:.25}\n#mtp-gl11 .stepTxt{min-height:44px;font-size:14px;color:#ddd!important;margin:8px 0}\n#mtp-gl11 .tl{display:flex;height:34px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #2a2a2a!important;margin:12px 0 6px}\n#mtp-gl11 .seg{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0d0d0d!important;transition:flex-grow .6s,opacity .4s;opacity:.2;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}\n#mtp-gl11 .seg.lit{opacity:1}\n#mtp-gl11 .log{font:12px/1.6 ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;background:#0a0a0a!important;color:#cfcfcf!important;border:1px solid #232323!important;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;min-height:96px;margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word}\n#mtp-gl11 .log b{color:#F0A06A!important}\n#mtp-gl11 input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:#F0A06A}\n#mtp-gl11 label{font-size:13px;color:#bbb!important;display:block;margin:10px 0 4px}\n#mtp-gl11 .val{color:#fff!important;font-weight:700}\n#mtp-gl11 .bars{margin-top:14px}\n#mtp-gl11 .bar{margin:8px 0}\n#mtp-gl11 .bar .lb{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px;color:#ddd!important}\n#mtp-gl11 .bar .tr{height:16px;background:#1c1c1c!important;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}\n#mtp-gl11 .bar .fl{height:100%;width:0;border-radius:99px;transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n#mtp-gl11 .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start}\n#mtp-gl11 .card{background:#151515!important;border:1px solid #2a2a2a!important;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .25s,transform .25s}\n#mtp-gl11 .card:hover{border-color:#5B8CF7!important;transform:translateY(-2px)}\n#mtp-gl11 .card h4{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#fff!important}\n#mtp-gl11 .card p{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#aaa!important;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s}\n#mtp-gl11 .card.open p{max-height:120px}\n#mtp-gl11 .card .plus{float:right;color:#F0A06A!important;font-weight:700}\n#mtp-gl11 code{background:#1f1f1f!important;color:#F0A06A!important;border:0!important;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px}\n#mtp-gl11 .ft{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px 24px 16px;border-top:1px solid #222!important;font-size:12px;color:#777!important;margin-top:12px}\n#mtp-gl11 .ft a{color:#9a9a9a!important}\n#mtp-gl11 .ft .brand{color:#76B900!important;font-weight:700}\n@media (max-width:640px){#mtp-gl11 .hd{padding:18px 16px 12px}#mtp-gl11 h3{font-size:19px}#mtp-gl11 .tabs{padding:0 12px}#mtp-gl11 .tab{font-size:12px;padding:10px 6px}#mtp-gl11 .pn{padding:16px}#mtp-gl11 .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}#mtp-gl11 .seg{font-size:9px}#mtp-gl11 .ft{padding:12px 16px}}\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;div id=&quot;mtp-gl11&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;hd&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;OpenAI · gpt-live-1.1&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;h3&gt;GPT-Live-1.1, explained&lt;/h3&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;sub&quot;&gt;Full-duplex voice model in the API. $0.05/min active, $0.02/min standby.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;tabs&quot; role=&quot;tablist&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;tab on&quot; data-t=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How it works&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Standby mode&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Cost calculator&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;3&quot;&gt;What changed&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;pn on&quot; id=&quot;gl11p0&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 820 220&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; role=&quot;img&quot; aria-label=&quot;GPT-Live-1.1 architecture&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;defs&gt;\n        &lt;radialGradient id=&quot;gl11orb&quot; cx=&quot;35%&quot; cy=&quot;35%&quot;&gt;&lt;stop offset=&quot;0&quot; stop-color=&quot;#FBD3B0&quot;/&gt;&lt;stop offset=&quot;.6&quot; stop-color=&quot;#F0A06A&quot;/&gt;&lt;stop offset=&quot;1&quot; stop-color=&quot;#D9774A&quot;/&gt;&lt;/radialGradient&gt;\n        &lt;radialGradient id=&quot;gl11orb2&quot; cx=&quot;35%&quot; cy=&quot;35%&quot;&gt;&lt;stop offset=&quot;0&quot; stop-color=&quot;#D6E2FF&quot;/&gt;&lt;stop offset=&quot;.6&quot; stop-color=&quot;#7EA4FA&quot;/&gt;&lt;stop offset=&quot;1&quot; stop-color=&quot;#3F74F2&quot;/&gt;&lt;/radialGradient&gt;\n      &lt;/defs&gt;\n      &lt;g id=&quot;gl11n0&quot; class=&quot;node&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;rect x=&quot;10&quot; y=&quot;70&quot; width=&quot;160&quot; height=&quot;80&quot; rx=&quot;14&quot; fill=&quot;#151515&quot; stroke=&quot;#3a3a3a&quot;/&gt;\n        &lt;text x=&quot;90&quot; y=&quot;104&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#fff&quot; font-size=&quot;15&quot; font-weight=&quot;700&quot;&gt;User audio&lt;/text&gt;\n        &lt;text x=&quot;90&quot; y=&quot;126&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#999&quot; font-size=&quot;12&quot;&gt;WebRTC / WebSocket / SIP&lt;/text&gt;\n      &lt;/g&gt;\n      &lt;path id=&quot;gl11a0&quot; class=&quot;flow&quot; d=&quot;M172 100 H300&quot; stroke=&quot;#F0A06A&quot; stroke-width=&quot;3&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot;/&gt;\n      &lt;path id=&quot;gl11a1&quot; class=&quot;flow&quot; d=&quot;M300 122 H172&quot; stroke=&quot;#7EA4FA&quot; stroke-width=&quot;3&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot;/&gt;\n      &lt;g id=&quot;gl11n1&quot; class=&quot;node&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;circle class=&quot;pulse&quot; cx=&quot;380&quot; cy=&quot;110&quot; r=&quot;62&quot; fill=&quot;url(#gl11orb)&quot;/&gt;\n        &lt;text x=&quot;380&quot; y=&quot;106&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#1a0d05&quot; font-size=&quot;15&quot; font-weight=&quot;800&quot;&gt;GPT-Live-1.1&lt;/text&gt;\n        &lt;text x=&quot;380&quot; y=&quot;126&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#3a1d0b&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot; font-weight=&quot;600&quot;&gt;listens while speaking&lt;/text&gt;\n      &lt;/g&gt;\n      &lt;path id=&quot;gl11a2&quot; class=&quot;flow&quot; d=&quot;M444 96 H632&quot; stroke=&quot;#7EA4FA&quot; stroke-width=&quot;3&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot;/&gt;\n      &lt;path id=&quot;gl11a3&quot; class=&quot;flow&quot; d=&quot;M632 126 H444&quot; stroke=&quot;#F0A06A&quot; stroke-width=&quot;3&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot;/&gt;\n      &lt;g id=&quot;gl11n2&quot; class=&quot;node&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;circle cx=&quot;700&quot; cy=&quot;110&quot; r=&quot;66&quot; fill=&quot;url(#gl11orb2)&quot;/&gt;\n        &lt;text x=&quot;700&quot; y=&quot;104&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#071436&quot; font-size=&quot;14&quot; font-weight=&quot;800&quot;&gt;Backend model&lt;/text&gt;\n        &lt;text x=&quot;700&quot; y=&quot;122&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#0d2260&quot; font-size=&quot;10&quot; font-weight=&quot;600&quot;&gt;Astra · Luna · 3rd party&lt;/text&gt;\n      &lt;/g&gt;\n      &lt;text x=&quot;236&quot; y=&quot;88&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#bbb&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot;&gt;speech in&lt;/text&gt;\n      &lt;text x=&quot;236&quot; y=&quot;142&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#bbb&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot;&gt;speech out&lt;/text&gt;\n      &lt;text x=&quot;522&quot; y=&quot;84&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#bbb&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot;&gt;delegate tools&lt;/text&gt;\n      &lt;text x=&quot;522&quot; y=&quot;146&quot; text-anchor=&quot;middle&quot; fill=&quot;#bbb&quot; font-size=&quot;11&quot;&gt;result&lt;/text&gt;\n    &lt;/svg&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;stepTxt&quot; id=&quot;gl11st&quot;&gt;One model handles listening and speaking. No separate speech-to-text and text-to-speech chain.&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;button class=&quot;btn&quot; id=&quot;gl11next&quot;&gt;Step through ▸&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;button class=&quot;btn gh&quot; id=&quot;gl11all&quot;&gt;Show all&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;span class=&quot;note&quot; id=&quot;gl11ct&quot; style=&quot;margin:0&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;Delegation modes: &lt;code&gt;delegation.type&lt;/code&gt; = &lt;code&gt;client&lt;/code&gt; (your backend) or &lt;code&gt;responses&lt;/code&gt; (OpenAI models). Default context: 128,000 tokens.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;pn&quot; id=&quot;gl11p1&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;label&gt;Idle timeout &lt;code&gt;session.idle_timeout_s&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;span class=&quot;val&quot; id=&quot;gl11tv&quot;&gt;20&lt;/span&gt; s (allowed 5 to 60)&lt;/label&gt;\n    &lt;input type=&quot;range&quot; id=&quot;gl11to&quot; min=&quot;5&quot; max=&quot;60&quot; value=&quot;20&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;tl&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;seg&quot; id=&quot;gl11s0&quot; style=&quot;flex-grow:3;background:#F0A06A&quot;&gt;Active · talking&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;seg&quot; id=&quot;gl11s1&quot; style=&quot;flex-grow:2;background:#d9c2b0&quot;&gt;Silence (timeout)&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;seg&quot; id=&quot;gl11s2&quot; style=&quot;flex-grow:4;background:#7EA4FA&quot;&gt;Standby · $0.02/min&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;seg&quot; id=&quot;gl11s3&quot; style=&quot;flex-grow:2;background:#F0A06A&quot;&gt;Resumed&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; style=&quot;margin:8px 0 10px&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;btn&quot; id=&quot;gl11sim&quot;&gt;▶ Simulate a call&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;btn gh&quot; id=&quot;gl11rst&quot;&gt;Reset&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;pre class=&quot;log&quot; id=&quot;gl11log&quot;&gt;Press Simulate to walk through the standby events.&lt;/pre&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;WebRTC only. Keep the mic track active. Session ID and history are kept. First reply after a short utterance may be slower.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;pn&quot; id=&quot;gl11p2&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;label&gt;Session length: &lt;span class=&quot;val&quot; id=&quot;gl11mv&quot;&gt;60&lt;/span&gt; min&lt;/label&gt;\n    &lt;input type=&quot;range&quot; id=&quot;gl11min&quot; min=&quot;1&quot; max=&quot;480&quot; value=&quot;60&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;label&gt;Share of the session that is idle (in standby): &lt;span class=&quot;val&quot; id=&quot;gl11iv&quot;&gt;50&lt;/span&gt;%&lt;/label&gt;\n    &lt;input type=&quot;range&quot; id=&quot;gl11idle&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;95&quot; value=&quot;50&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;bars&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lb&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;All minutes at active rate ($0.05)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;val&quot; id=&quot;gl11c0&quot;&gt;$3.00&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fl&quot; id=&quot;gl11b0&quot; style=&quot;background:#F0A06A&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lb&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;With standby ($0.02 on idle minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;val&quot; id=&quot;gl11c1&quot;&gt;$2.10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fl&quot; id=&quot;gl11b1&quot; style=&quot;background:#7EA4FA&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot; id=&quot;gl11sv&quot;&gt;Voice layer only. Illustrative: the timeout window itself bills at the active rate, and backend model and tool usage are billed separately.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;pn&quot; id=&quot;gl11p3&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Accents &lt;span class=&quot;plus&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;More natural and consistent accents across languages, per OpenAI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Transcription &lt;span class=&quot;plus&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Transcribes speech more accurately than GPT-Live-1, per the model page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Letters and numbers &lt;span class=&quot;plus&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Better handling of precise details like letters and numbers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Task completion &lt;span class=&quot;plus&quot;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;More reliable instruction following and task completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;bars&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lb&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Active rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;val&quot;&gt;$0.05/min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fl gl11pb&quot; data-w=&quot;100&quot; style=&quot;background:#F0A06A&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lb&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Standby rate (new, also on GPT-Live-1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;val&quot;&gt;$0.02/min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fl gl11pb&quot; data-w=&quot;40&quot; style=&quot;background:#7EA4FA&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;OpenAI published no benchmark scores for 1.1. All 4 gains above are self-reported.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div class=&quot;ft&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;span&gt;Sources: &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-live-1.1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;model page&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/live-conversations&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Live guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;span class=&quot;brand&quot;&gt;Built by Marktechpost&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;script&gt;\n(function(){\nvar R=document.getElementById('mtp-gl11');\nfunction $(i){return document.getElementById(i)}\nfunction resize(){try{parent.postMessage({mtpFrame:'gl11',height:R.offsetHeight+40},'*')}catch(e){}}\nvar tabs=R.querySelectorAll('.tab');\nfor(var i=0;i&lt;tabs.length;i++){tabs[i].addEventListener('click',function(){\n  for(var j=0;j&lt;tabs.length;j++){tabs[j].classList.remove('on');$('gl11p'+j).classList.remove('on')}\n  this.classList.add('on');var t=this.getAttribute('data-t');$('gl11p'+t).classList.add('on');\n  if(t==='2')calc(); if(t==='3')priceBars(); setTimeout(resize,60);\n})}\n/* step-through */\nvar steps=[\n {on:['gl11n0','gl11a0','gl11n1'],t:'1. Caller audio streams in. The model keeps listening even while it is speaking (full duplex).',c:'Step 1 of 3'},\n {on:['gl11n1','gl11a2','gl11n2'],t:'2. For reasoning or tools, the voice model delegates to a backend model while the conversation continues.',c:'Step 2 of 3'},\n {on:['gl11n2','gl11a3','gl11n1','gl11a1','gl11n0'],t:'3. The result returns and is spoken back. ASR transcripts and response text come back natively.',c:'Step 3 of 3'}];\nvar ids=['gl11n0','gl11n1','gl11n2','gl11a0','gl11a1','gl11a2','gl11a3'],si=-1;\nfunction showAll(){ids.forEach(function(x){$(x).classList.remove('dim')})}\n$('gl11next').addEventListener('click',function(){si=(si+1)%steps.length;var s=steps[si];\n  ids.forEach(function(x){$(x).classList.toggle('dim',s.on.indexOf(x)&lt;0)});$('gl11st').textContent=s.t;$('gl11ct').textContent=s.c;});\n$('gl11all').addEventListener('click',function(){si=-1;showAll();$('gl11st').textContent='One model handles listening and speaking. No separate speech-to-text and text-to-speech chain.';$('gl11ct').textContent='Overview'});\n/* standby */\n$('gl11to').addEventListener('input',function(){$('gl11tv').textContent=this.value;$('gl11s1').style.flexGrow=(1+this.value/15).toFixed(2)});\nvar timers=[];\nfunction rst(){timers.forEach(clearTimeout);timers=[];for(var k=0;k&lt;4;k++)$('gl11s'+k).classList.remove('lit');$('gl11log').innerHTML='Press Simulate to walk through the standby events.'}\n$('gl11rst').addEventListener('click',rst);\n$('gl11sim').addEventListener('click',function(){rst();var to=$('gl11to').value;var L=$('gl11log');L.innerHTML='';\n var ev=[[0,'&lt;b&gt;session.resumed&lt;/b&gt;  first wake on speech, inference active ($0.05/min)'],\n  [1,'silence detected, waiting '+to+' s (idle_timeout_s)'],\n  [2,'&lt;b&gt;session.paused&lt;/b&gt;  standby, WebRTC call stays open ($0.02/min)'],\n  [3,'user speaks, &lt;b&gt;session.resumed&lt;/b&gt;  same session ID, history restored']];\n ev.forEach(function(e,n){timers.push(setTimeout(function(){$('gl11s'+e[0]).classList.add('lit');L.innerHTML+=(n?'\\n':'')+e[1];resize()},n*1100))});\n});\n/* calculator */\nfunction money(v){return '$'+v.toFixed(2)}\nfunction calc(){var m=+$('gl11min').value,p=+$('gl11idle').value/100;$('gl11mv').textContent=m;$('gl11iv').textContent=Math.round(p*100);\n var a=m*0.05,b=m*(1-p)*0.05+m*p*0.02;$('gl11c0').textContent=money(a);$('gl11c1').textContent=money(b);\n $('gl11b0').style.width='100%';$('gl11b1').style.width=(a?b/a*100:0)+'%';\n $('gl11sv').textContent='Saves '+money(a-b)+' ('+(a?((a-b)/a*100).toFixed(0):0)+'%) on the voice layer. Illustrative: the timeout window itself bills at the active rate, and backend model and tool usage are billed separately.'}\n$('gl11min').addEventListener('input',calc);$('gl11idle').addEventListener('input',calc);\nfunction priceBars(){var b=R.querySelectorAll('.gl11pb');for(var k=0;k&lt;b.length;k++){b[k].style.width='0';(function(el){setTimeout(function(){el.style.width=el.getAttribute('data-w')+'%'},50)})(b[k])}}\nvar cards=R.querySelectorAll('.card');for(var c=0;c&lt;cards.length;c++){cards[c].addEventListener('click',function(){this.classList.toggle('open');this.querySelector('.plus').textContent=this.classList.contains('open')?'−':'+';setTimeout(resize,420)})}\nwindow.addEventListener('load',resize);window.addEventListener('resize',resize);setTimeout(resize,300);\n})();\n&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;\"></iframe>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-key-takeaways\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>GPT-Live-1.1 is live in the API as <code>gpt-live-1.1</code>.</li>\n   <li>Standby cuts idle WebRTC billing from $0.05 to $0.02 per minute.</li>\n   <li>Idle timeout is configurable from 5 to 60 seconds.</li>\n   <li>Accent, transcription and task gains are self-reported, with no scores.</li>\n   <li>Backend reasoning and tools are billed separately from voice minutes.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Check out the <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-live-1.1\">model page</a>, the <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/live-conversations\">Live conversations guide</a> and the <a href=\"https://community.openai.com/t/gpt-live-1-1-has-arrived-in-the-api/1418537\">announcement</a>. You can check the deployment options and specs here through our <strong><a href=\"https://aicampaign.live/gpu-1\">GPULeaderboard.com chrome extension</a></strong>.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Also,&nbsp;feel free to follow us on&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/follow?screen_name=marktechpost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Twitter</mark></a></strong>&nbsp;and don’t forget to join our&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/machinelearningnews/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">150k+ML SubReddit</a></strong>&nbsp;and Subscribe to&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/08/google-elephant-goldfish-model-plugin-spec-review-coding-agents/#aids-signup\">our Newsletter</a></strong>. Wait! are you on telegram?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://t.me/machinelearningresearchnews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">now you can join us on telegram as well.</a></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Need to partner with us for promoting your GitHub Repo OR Hugging Face Page OR Product Release OR Webinar etc.?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://promotions.marktechpost.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Connect with us</mark></a></strong></p>\n  <!-- MOLONGUI AUTHORSHIP PLUGIN 5.3.2 -->\n  <!-- https://www.molongui.com/wordpress-plugin-post-authors -->\n  <div class=\"m-a-box \" data-box-layout=\"slim\" data-box-position=\"below\" data-multiauthor=\"false\" data-author-id=\"676\" data-author-type=\"user\" data-author-archived=\"\">\n   <div class=\"m-a-box-container\">\n    <div class=\"m-a-box-tab m-a-box-content m-a-box-profile\" data-profile-layout=\"layout-1\" data-author-ref=\"user-676\" itemscope itemid=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/michal-sutter/\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\">\n     <div class=\"m-a-box-content-middle\">\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-avatar\" data-source=\"local\">\n       <a class=\"m-a-box-avatar-url\" href=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg-150x150.png\" class=\"attachment-150x150 size-150x150\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" srcset=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg-150x150.png 150w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg-70x70.png 70w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg-24x24.png 24w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg-48x48.png 48w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg-96x96.png 96w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg-300x300.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" data-attachment-id=\"72715\" data-permalink=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0r9sv6nw5xk-zkphw_uarv5vw1st6oslnlunovwg/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg.png\" data-orig-size=\"832,960\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/a-professional-linkedin-headshot-photogr_0jcmb0R9Sv6nW5XK-zkPHw_uARV5VW1ST6osLNlunoVWg.png\"></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-data\">\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-name\">\n        <h5 itemprop=\"name\"><a class=\"m-a-box-name-url \" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/michal-sutter/\" itemprop=\"url\"> Michal Sutter</a></h5>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-meta\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"m-a-box-data-toggle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-more-posts\">+ posts</span></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-bio\" itemprop=\"description\">\n        <p>Michal Sutter is a data science professional with a Master of Science in Data Science from the University of Padova. With a solid foundation in statistical analysis, machine learning, and data engineering, Michal excels at transforming complex datasets into actionable insights.</p>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-related\" data-related-layout=\"layout-1\"></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- CONTENT END 2 -->\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "OpenAI 发布了 GPT-Live-1.1，这是一款支持待机模式的全双工语音模型，可将 WebRTC 空闲成本降至每分钟 $0.02，但此次更新未公布基准测试成绩。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "OpenAI 发布了 GPT-Live-1.1，这是一款支持待机模式的全双工语音模型，可将 WebRTC 空闲成本降至每分钟 $0.02，但此次更新未公布基准测试成绩。",
  "summary": "OpenAI 已推出 GPT-Live-1.1，这是一款全双工语音模型，可通过 API 使用，模型 ID 为 gpt-live-1.1。该模型在单一流中处理音频和文本输入与输出，并原生支持轮次检测和 ASR。与 GPT-Live-1 相比，主要改进包括口音更自然、转录准确率更高，以及对字母和数字的处理能力更强。新增的待机模式会在静音期间暂停推理，同时保持 WebRTC 连接，使空闲成本从每分钟 $0.05 降至 $0.02。该模型支持流式处理、函数调用，以及将任务委派给 GPT-6 Astra 和 Luna 等后端文本模型，但不支持图像或视频输入、结构化输出，且未公布基准测试成绩。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "GPT-Live-1.1 是一款全双工语音模型，可在单一流中处理音频和文本。",
      "explanation": "该模型取代了传统的语音转文本、LLM 和文本转语音级联流程，支持同时聆听和说话，并原生具备 ASR 和轮次检测能力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "待机模式将 WebRTC 空闲成本从每分钟 $0.05 降至 $0.02。",
      "explanation": "待机期间，推理会暂停，但连接保持开启；用户可通过 wake_policy.type、idle_timeout_s（5-60 秒）和 vad_threshold 设置进行配置。"
    },
    {
